  "solution": {
    "text": "Given lights are of same wavelength.\nHence stopping potential will remain same.\nSince $I_2>I_1$, hence saturation current corresponding to $\\mathrm{I}_2$ will be greater than that corresponding to $\\mathrm{I}_1$.",
